{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cd18806584088b90e019defb945710d5b42da13d43c3ae7b982da0c939e7c08b", "ja": "（今日は休みの亜利沙と共に、都内のメイド喫茶に\n行ってきた。亜利沙はご機嫌の様子だ）", "zh": "（今天和休假的亚利沙一起去了东京都内的女仆咖啡馆。亚利沙看起来心情很不错）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "51ec98345e8e7b4e0cd6241394f7e08b8a67783e3b9c9ceacb9fb95d89750d7f", "ja": "はあ……最高でしたねぇ、メイド喫茶……。\nチェキもいっぱい撮って……至福のひと時ですぅ♪", "zh": "哈啊……女仆咖啡厅真是太棒了呢……\n还拍了好多大头贴……真是幸福的时光呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5544f1b9badb582936d406c17f13d57ca87a93bd8e2be860248bb973f76f1b85", "ja": "亜利沙、メイド喫茶が好きだったんだな。\nてっきり、アイドルに関する場所に行くのかと。", "zh": "原来亚利沙喜欢女仆咖啡厅啊。我还以为会去什么和偶像有关的地方呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "962b1d5375d8bfd6cbc227dd52ad01e6dbd48fe6fcbb740887fb63052bad2c7a", "ja": "もちろん、チェックしてますよ！　メイド喫茶が\nきっかけで、アイドルちゃんになる人もいますしね。", "zh": "我当然有在关注啦！也有人是因为在女仆咖啡厅\n工作这个契机，才成为偶像女孩子的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "9f04bc4e15ae17695b5aadd8440cd5f708b9082eca6065cf58e61067cb4bc544", "ja": "それに、ご主人様に愛を届けるメイドの皆さんは\nいわばコンカフェのアイドルなのです！", "zh": "而且，为主人送上爱的女仆们，也可以说是女仆主题咖啡厅的偶像呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1005_p", "source_sha256": "648bbed4614e58f72c1e2fb2a91ca29589d4febea11eb9daaddf801c77bad856", "ja": "確かに、そうだな。\n亜利沙のアンテナの広さには恐れ入るよ。", "zh": "确实，你说得对。\n亚利沙的触角真是广，让我佩服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "59914ed19773f8f64572c9713eebc256372731205e70cbcceff755db894440df", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　{$P$}さん\nメイド喫茶、楽しんでいただけましたか？", "zh": "谢谢！{$P$}先生\n觉得女仆咖啡店有意思吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c5431fbdf9cffae5fed1806b4115d3d65c388ecb0b9d5ce7d6c17c2ff622c834", "ja": "ああ、楽しかったよ。ただ、メイドさんと一緒に\nオムライスの前でポーズを取るというのは……。", "zh": "啊，挺开心的。不过，要和女仆一起在蛋包饭前摆姿势……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "b1a8d8e292494f8efa1f9bb8283fc394c65f1ea135b82b572224593fb83f568a", "ja": "何を言っているんですか！　あれこそ醍醐味！\nメイドさんによる最高のご褒美ですよ！？", "zh": "你在说什么呀！那才是精髓所在！由女仆亲自带来的最高奖励啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c575a370c0c00b9aa962daf0d25270ce7db99fbe79ccada5f2b91d8644c63f0b", "ja": "お、おお……まあ確かに、滅多に味わえない瞬間だし、\n恥ずかしがってちゃもったいない、か……。", "zh": "哦、哦哦……嗯，你说得也有道理，毕竟这是难得一尝的时刻，害羞的话确实太可惜了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "a1cc91d056359b3da9d5f1b7d2a48da157ad72d49393e93fd916606b22062ca3", "ja": "そうです！　あの笑顔とおまじないがお料理を一層\nおいしくしてくれるんです！　そう、おいしく……。", "zh": "没错！那个笑容和魔法，会让料理变得更加美味！没错，美味……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1011_p", "source_sha256": "990ef305a3c5dfaae016277356934ca294c83a2f752539857cb94d49a3c1f9cd", "ja": "ん？　亜利沙？", "zh": "嗯？亚利沙？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "c742750eb2cd1a884b564a091e8cbc81a225ccf026007521e2caeaea94bcaeba", "ja": "はっ！？　いえいえ、何でもありません！　あの、\n{$P$}さん、お腹空いてませんか！？", "zh": "哈！？没没，什么都没有！那个，{$P$}先生，您肚子饿不饿！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8f84f1f5ce655cf83960f2661e5ba7958ecc337d24a987975ba4cf523a4c150a", "ja": "えっ？　さっき色々食べたからな……。", "zh": "诶？刚才吃了不少东西，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "96a6082615d632b4187e67e7961b6f1e26e0f362ce8f62d711962992b43ddc02", "ja": "あっ、で、ですよね！　ありさってば、うっかり\nしていました～！　何言ってるんでしょう、うう～！", "zh": "啊，对、对哦！亚利沙真是的，一不小心就忘了～！我到底在说什么呀，呜呜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1015_p", "source_sha256": "21b9abff893ae7f1980dda537cf70831c43be4ea98ed387c7a674d761be3fb70", "ja": "ん？　もし行きたい場所とか、やりたいことがあるなら\n言ってくれ。せっかくの休みだ、満喫しないとな！", "zh": "嗯？要是有想去的地方，或者想做的事，就告诉我吧。难得有假期，可得好好享受一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "1056494d9d05558c143dedc630d565134c39314dffd6134a4c075f48b89cef33", "ja": "{$P$}さん、いいんですか？\nええと、実は……ですね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，真的可以吗？\n那个，其实……是这样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "b83109d39f14a8bf103df8ce1e047b78d2a87d717504e725a09473aeea9c3e04", "ja": "ありさ、クッキーを焼いてきたんです……。\nオムライスのあとで、お腹いっぱいカモですけど……。", "zh": "亚利沙烤了些饼干带过来……\n虽然吃完蛋包饭之后，可能已经很饱了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1018_p", "source_sha256": "dd378561bec52f9901759954e60f7fbabb3b9b527f37e7ee36ff898fb15ab9dc", "ja": "そうだったのか。\nそれなら、食後のデザートでいただこうかな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。  \n那就当作饭后甜点吃吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "b81d25f510230f9ea4530f89f20f9363705ea124a9090d95e2a5e690d4935bad", "ja": "は、はい！　えっと、ちょっと自信はないですが……\nあ！　美味しくないというわけではなくて……！", "zh": "是、是的！那个……虽然我有点没信心……\n啊！不是说不好吃，只是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0514_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "869ec9bc1b1cd4028d962a7af4f5e28ca7e5bbec6de18de691921942a15cde6c", "ja": "せめてもの気持ちとして……\nその、「おいしくな～れ」……します、ね？", "zh": "至少表达一下心意……\n那个，我来做“变得好吃吧～”……好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
